              "ImageDescription": {
                "value": "The image captures the vibrant and illuminated skyline of Ho Chi Minh City (formerly known as Saigon) at night. Prominent skyscrapers from left to right, including the <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/IFC_One_Saigon\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:IFC One Saigon\">IFC One Saigon</a>, Ho Chi Minh City Customs Department Building, Bitexco Office Building, Harbour View Tower, Osic Building, <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bitexco_Financial_Tower\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:Bitexco Financial Tower\">Bitexco Financial Tower</a>, Liberty Central Saigon Riverside Hotel, Renaissance Riverside Hotel Saigon, Melinh Point Tower, <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Saigon_Times_Square\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:Saigon Times Square\">Saigon Times Square</a>, Hilton Saigon Hotel, <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vietcombank_Tower\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:Vietcombank Tower\">Vietcombank Tower</a>, <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Saigon_Centre\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:Saigon Centre\">Saigon Centre</a>, Sheraton Grand Opera Saigon Hotel, The Landmark, Saigon Riverside Office Center, Lotte Hotel Saigon and some significant low-rise buildings <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hotel_Majestic_(Saigon)\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:Hotel Majestic (Saigon)\">Hotel Majestic</a>, Seaprodex 2-4-6 Đồng Khởi, Riverside Hotel, <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tr%E1%BA%A7n_H%C6%B0ng_%C4%90%E1%BA%A1o\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:Trần Hưng Đạo\">Trần Hưng Đạo</a> statue at <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/M%C3%AA_Linh_Square\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:Mê Linh Square\"> Mê Linh Square</a>, IBC Building, Vietnam People's Naval Army Barracks, Tôn Đức Thắng Museum",
